    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0314" n="244" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg244"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 8, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Adverting to my note to you of the 3d
                    instant, relative to the improper position in which the British flag was placed
                    on board the schooner James Campbell, captured on a charge of breach of
                    blockade, I now have the honor to enclose to you, for your information, the copy
                    of a further communication just received from the Secretary of the Navy on that
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d201-a1.xml" xpointer="d201-a1"/>
            </div>
